==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is relatively simple. Just like the other stages in the event, all that's really needed is spamming strong anti-Dark Cats like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] if you have it. The Owlbrows and Otta-smack-us are not strong enough to be much of a threat, even in {{4c}}, so don't worry about them. In {{4c}}, you can just use [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] instead of Ring Girl Cat.

